<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>Pending Approval</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 400px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #FF9800;
        }

        p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .btn-retry {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #007BFF;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-retry:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        a.logout {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            color: #dc3545;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Approval Pending</h2>
        <p>You have successfully assigned yourself to a course. However, an Administrator must approve your request
            before you can access the Teacher Dashboard and begin managing questions.</p>
        <p>Please check back later.</p>
        <a href="/teacher-dashboard" class="btn-retry">Check Status</a>
        <a href="/logout" class="logout">Logout</a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>